<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed mixed on Monday in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index rose 1.55 to 639.35, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.03.</p>
<p>Decliners beat advancers 289 to 261.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 27,110,100 compared with 25,877,195 on Friday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EDT/2030 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1830))</p>
